  "description": "Lim Seo-Jun, a college student, is popular with guys but struggles with his lack of popularity among the opposite sex. At the opening assembly, he tries to get closer to the girls, but they all flock around Yun-Woo, a fellow student who has just returned from a break. Envious of Yoon-Woo's charm, Seo-Jun drinks too much and passes out. When he wakes up, he finds Yun-Woo unusually affectionate—and feels something strangely stiff in a very unexpected place.\n\n*\"Seo-Jun hyung, can you feel it?\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Part of Bomtoon’s and Lezhin’s Saekgwi Danpyeonseon (색귀 단편선) Collection or Dirty Demon Collection in English.*",
